## Part 3 — Why My Settings Are Right

**Q6.** The last layer has no activation because the model needs to output any 
number — trapping it between 0 and 1 makes no sense for a house price. MAE 
measures average dollar error which actually means something, accuracy doesn't 
apply here, and we use training stats only so we don't sneak test data 
information into the model before it sees it.

**Q7.** My curve goes flat around epoch 50-100 but I trained to 200. More epochs 
past that point didn't improve accuracy, I need to decrease epochs for better 
results.

